DE:
Ich zieh in {{TAG:0004:0006:0000}} Tagen um!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}} Huaaah,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
bin ich aufgeregt!!!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Vielleicht...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
sollt ich's mir noch mal überlegen?{{TAG:0008:0000:0300000007000000}}
Ja, bitte geh nicht!!!
Nö, passt schon so.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Dopodomani mi trasferisco{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Dovrei finire di imballare
gli scatoloni,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma continuo a farmi
distrarre dai programmi in tivù.{{TAG:0008:0000:0300000007000000}}
Non trasferirti!
Imballa in fretta!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Ich zieh übermorgen um,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Eigentlich wollt ich schon alles
gepackt haben...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000E:}} Aber dann kommt
immer was Tolles im Fernsehen!!!{{TAG:0008:0000:0300000007000000}}
Dann bleib doch hier!
Du solltest echt packen!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}Şey,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} öbür gün taşınıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Aslında artık eşyaları
toplamam lazım,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ama televizyonda
bir şey görünce sürekli dağılıyorum.{{TAG:0008:0000:0300000007000000}}
Taşınma!
Toparlanmaya başla!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Che?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}} Come faccio ad andarmene,
dopo che mi hai detto una cosa
del genere, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}OK, è ufficiale.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sì,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} il trasloco è annullato!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Che bello, ci vediamo in giro!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Ne?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}} Sen böyle şeyler söyleyeceksen
ben nasıl taşınayım, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Tamam, resmî olarak açıklıyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Evet,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
taşınma iptal!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Galiba etrafta yine beni görmeye devam edeceksin!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Wait.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I just thought of something!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I can't leave before we get to know
each other better!
I don't think I'm gonna move after
all.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Not until you and me have
broken bread together!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
So I'll be seeing you around,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Espera,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} es que he pensado algo!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡No puedo marcharme hasta que
no nos conozcamos mejor!
Ya no creo que me vaya a mudar.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡No hasta que tú y yo no nos
conozcamos mucho mejor!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Pues nada, ¡ya nos veremos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Aspetta,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ho appena pensato che...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Beh, ecco, non posso andarmene
prima di averti conosciut{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} meglio!
Sai che ti dico? Niente più trasloco!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}O almeno non prima che saremo
diventati amiconi per la pelle...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ci si vede in giro,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Warte mal!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mir ist was eingefallen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ich kann nicht weg!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nicht, bevor
wir uns richtig kennen und mögen!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich glaub, ich bleib einfach da,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
äh, he he he!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bis ganz bald,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Dur.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Aklıma bir şey geldi!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Birbirimizi daha iyi tanımadan gidemem!
Galiba taşınmıyorum.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}En azından seninle
bir sofraya oturmadan olmaz!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Buralarda görüşürüz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Parece que te da totalmente igual{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
que me marche.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Y eso no me gusta!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Conocerme es quererme!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Por eso
sé que solo necesitas más tiempo
para conocerme mejor!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Así que ni hablar, nada de mudarme.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡No hasta que no sepas apreciarme!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pues nada,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡no me mudo, hala!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ya nos veremos,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Sembra che non ti importi neanche
un po' che io mi trasferisca.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sono quasi offeso!
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Datti tempo per conoscermi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ti assicuro che ne vale la pena!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Sai cosa ti dico? Non me ne vado
più da nessuna parte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non prima
che tu abbia capito quanto valgo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Perciò{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} il trasloco è annullato!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ci si vede,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Dir ist wohl ganz egal, dass ich
weggehe.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Und das find ich doof!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ich bin nämlich echt liebenswert!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das wirst du auch noch merken!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Darum kann ich nicht umziehen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Nicht, bevor du mich dolle magst!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Und darum {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}ist der Umzug vergessen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bis baaald,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Eddai, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non ci casco.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tanto lo so che sono io il tuo
migliore amico!
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Si vede subito che non vedi l'ora
di urlarmi:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} "Non andartene!".{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ce l'hai scritto in faccia!
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ah ah ah{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sei solo troppo timid{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}
per ammetterlo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ma non fa niente,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ti capisco!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Quindi{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} niente più trasloco!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Mitico! Usciremo tutte le volte
che ti va!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Yeah!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Thanks for everything!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}
I know {{TAG:0005:0006:}} won't be the
same without me.
It'll probably be like a dinner table {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
without {{TAG:0005:0013:0000}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:000E:}}but you
can always eat more dessert.
